# VED testing

- Domain changes → unit under `src/lib/ved/__tests__/`.
- Sensitive mutations → `PROTECTED_V1_MUTATIONS` (`access.ts`).
- Gate: `npm run test:ci`.
- Dual-path create/pay/claim/map/approve → update `containers/api` too (D24).
